msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Find more details about the `EstimatorV2` methods in the [Estimator API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2).\n"
"- Decide what [execution mode](/guides/execution-modes) to run your job in.\n"
"- Learn about [noise management with Estimator](/guides/estimator-noise-management).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"- Temukan detail lebih lanjut tentang metode `EstimatorV2` di [referensi API Estimator](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2).\n"
"- Tentukan [mode eksekusi](/guides/execution-modes) mana yang akan digunakan untuk job kamu.\n"
"- Pelajari tentang [manajemen noise dengan Estimator](/guides/estimator-noise-management).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
